{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id38219556"}, "name":{"label":"Misty 8"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-03T05:24:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.230.0"}, "id":{"label":"12970752095"}, "title":{"label":"Better than my memory-mostly"}, "content":{"label":"This free pill reminder is simple to set up and effectively lets me know when it’s time to take my next pills—and which ones—in my three-a-day cycle. I actually think it’s worth paying for—and will make a contribution when I finish this review. But after using it for a few weeks, I’ve been frustrated that it fails to stay loaded in the background without warning and, therefore, doesn’t remind when it’s time for the next round. Reliability is critical if the app is to succeed in reminding users when to take their meds. It also lacks a delete button to erase a pill and its dosage when the user makes a mistake or stops using a particular medicine. \n     Those shortcomings must be fixed, or the app wont fulfill its primary mission.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=662170995&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
