{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id226673512"}, "name":{"label":"Gibborim068"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-25T06:14:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.228.1"}, "id":{"label":"12934701832"}, "title":{"label":"Meds reminder is an app you try never to forget!!"}, "content":{"label":"Whether you’re supposed to take your medication once daily, or several medications spread throughout the day, I highly recommend this app. Historically, I only took 1 pill in the evenings  for high blood pressure. Even then, I would often get confused and wonder if I just took it, or am I remembering taking it yesterday.  Very annoying. Recently I had kidney stones/surgery which required that I take 4 more pills spanning the morning noon and evenings. It became impossible for me to manage. I searched for an app to remind me, and immediately confirm that I took them in that moment. It works perfectly. I am very organized and responsible with meds directly as a result of this apps efficiencies. I definitely recommend it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=662170995&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
